# Thieving Otter: "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent" (CR 603.2, 120.2): only the Otter's own damage. On turn 3 the
# Otter and Memnite attack; Bot2's Ornithopter blocks the Otter, Memnite deals 1 to Bot2, and Bot1 draws nothing for it (5 cards in
# hand after the turn's draw, still 5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Thieving Otter
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Thieving Otter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Attack(Thieving Otter > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Thieving Otter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
